            "2"
          ],
          "text": "* BAV199: two low-leakage diodes in series (pin 1 anode of diode 1, pin 3 the middle, pin 2 cathode of diode 2)\n.subckt BAV199 a1 mid k2\nD1 a1 mid DBAV199\nD2 mid k2 DBAV199\n* IS = the typical reverse current (3 pA at 75 V); N and RS fitted to the 25 C typical curve of fig. 2 with IS held there\n.model DBAV199 D(IS=3e-12 N=1.495 RS=0.58 CJO=2e-12 VJ=0.7 M=0.5 TT=1.15e-06)\n.ends BAV199"
        }
      },
